        "Title": "Flaming Falcone",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103655225269",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bb15423f-bc60-4c49-ae0b-ee0a8843cbcc).Image",
        "Description": "Sal Falcone has been in the crosshairs of Agent 47 for quite some time now. The private detective seems to be occupied lately with a part-time job as an assassin, so that effectively makes him a rival of Agent 47. Falcone&apos;s impressive body of work has caught the attention of many of our clients, and they would like to get rid of the guy. Assume the identity of the Street Performer, a know associate of Falcone, in order to get close enough so you can send him out with a bang!",
